        "text": "Page: WWE Super Tuesday. Sentence: Super Tuesday was a 1-hour professional wrestling television special event, produced by the World Wrestling Entertainment (WWE) that took place on 12 November 2002 (which was taped November 4 & 5) at the Fleet Center in Boston, Massachusetts and Verizon Wireless Arena in Manchester, New Hampshire, which featured matches from both Raw and SmackDown.\nPage: TD Garden. Sentence: TD Garden, often called Boston Garden and \"The Garden\", is a multi-purpose arena in Boston, Massachusetts.\nPage: TD Garden. Sentence: It opened in 1995 as a replacement for the original Boston Garden and has been known as Shawmut Center, FleetCenter, and TD Banknorth Garden.",
